      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级选项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All fields are required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有字段均为必填"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All fields except the path prefix are required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除路径前缀外均为必填"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another backup is running right now. Try again when it finishes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前有另一个备份正在运行，等它结束后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another plan already backs up to this destination. Connect to its repository under Advanced options, or pick a different folder or bucket path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有其他计划备份到这个位置了。可以在“高级选项”里接入它的仓库，或者换一个位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back Up Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backblaze B2 keeps a hidden copy of everything a backup deletes, and keeps charging for it. Turn on the bucket's “Keep only the last version of the file” lifecycle rule so B2 clears them. [Why this is needed](https://keelhaven.app/#faq)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backblaze B2 会为备份删掉的每一样东西保留一份隐藏副本，并持续计费。请在存储桶上打开「Keep only the last version of the file」生命周期规则，让 B2 清理它们。[为什么需要这样做](https://keelhaven.app/zh/#faq)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backed up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
