          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已于 %@ 完成备份验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backups are encrypted before leaving your Mac. This password is stored in your Keychain — without it, backups cannot be restored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份在离开您的 Mac 之前就已加密。密码保存在钥匙串里——没有它就无法恢复备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bucket": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储桶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't preview right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在无法预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caps how fast a backup uploads, so it can't take the whole connection. Only affects backups to a server — a local disk ignores it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限制备份的上传速度，免得整条带宽被占满。只对备份到服务器有效，备份到本地磁盘时不起作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a destination folder to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择备份目标文件夹后继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a point in time. Files are restored into a new folder — nothing is overwritten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择一个时间点。文件会恢复到一个新文件夹里，不会覆盖任何现有文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the folders to back up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择要备份的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose where to put the restored files. Keelhaven creates a new subfolder — existing files are never touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择恢复文件的存放位置。Keelhaven 会新建一个子文件夹，绝不会动您现有的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选取…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cleaning up old snapshots…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
