    "Fill in the remaining S3 fields.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填写剩余的 S3 字段后继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill in the remaining SFTP fields.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填写剩余的 SFTP 字段后继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fix the destination issue shown above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先解决上方提示的目标问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folders": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a repository created earlier — by another plan, a previous install, or another Mac. Your password is verified against it; no new repository is created.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于之前创建过的备份仓库——比如其他计划、重装系统前或另一台 Mac 留下的。会先验证您输入的密码，不会新建仓库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a restic REST server (rest-server) using default settings — no TLS, no --private-repos, no --append-only. Leave username and password blank if the server has no authentication set up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于按默认设置运行的 restic REST server（rest-server）——未启用 TLS、--private-repos 和 --append-only。服务器没有设置认证时，用户名和密码留空即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frequency": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "频率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Generate Strong Password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动生成强密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How often should it run?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多久备份一次？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It runs by itself every day": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之后每天自动备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keelhaven": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Keelhaven automatically copies your important folders to a backup drive, so nothing is lost if your Mac ever breaks or goes missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keelhaven 会自动把您的重要文件夹复制到备份硬盘上。这样即使 Mac 坏了或丢了，文件也不会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keelhaven backup status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keelhaven 备份状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keelhaven is already running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keelhaven 已经在运行了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keelhaven needs restic %@ or newer. Update it with: brew upgrade restic": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keelhaven 需要 restic %@ 或更新版本。请用以下命令更新：brew upgrade restic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a set number of backups": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留固定份数的备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep everything": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the last": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留最近"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KiB/s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KiB/秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Larger packs mean fewer, bigger uploads. Worth raising for cloud storage that charges per request; leave it alone otherwise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包越大，上传的次数越少、每次越大。按请求次数计费的云存储值得调大，其他情况保持默认即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last backup %@ ago": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次备份是%@前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last backup failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次备份失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last backup on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次备份于 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以后再说"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave these empty unless a backup is too slow or takes too much of your connection. Empty means restic's own default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除非备份太慢或太占网速，否则留空即可。留空表示使用 restic 自己的默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading snapshots…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在读取备份记录…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local / External Drive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机 / 外置硬盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for its icon in the menu bar at the top right of your screen. Click it to manage your backups.\n\nDon't see the icon? Your menu bar is probably full — on Macs with a notch, macOS hides icons that don't fit. Quit another menu bar app or ⌘-drag an icon off the bar to make room, then relaunch Keelhaven.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在屏幕右上角的菜单栏里找它的图标，点击图标即可管理备份。\n\n看不到图标？菜单栏可能已经放满了——在带刘海的 Mac 上，放不下的图标会被系统隐藏。请退出一个其他菜单栏程序，或按住 ⌘ 键把某个图标拖出菜单栏腾出位置，然后重新打开 Keelhaven。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lower this on an external hard disk, where reading several files at once makes it slower. Raise it on a fast internal SSD.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "机械移动硬盘上同时读多个文件反而更慢，可以调低；内置固态硬盘则可以调高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MiB (4–128)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MiB（4–128）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Monthly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
