            "value": "尚未备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing has changed since the last backup, so a backup right now would store nothing new.\n\nNothing was written — this was only a preview.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与上次备份相比没有变化，现在备份也不会存入任何新内容。\n\n没有写入任何内容 —— 这只是一次预览。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is backed up yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有任何备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is excluded — every file in those folders is backed up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有排除任何东西 —— 这些文件夹里的所有文件都会备份。"
