    "Restoring… %lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在恢复… %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留策略"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retention cleanup running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留策略清理进行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs restic's own repository check after a backup, and only speaks up when something is wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在备份完成后运行 restic 自带的仓库检查，只在发现问题时才出声提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "S3, SFTP, REST server, or an existing repository": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S3、SFTP、REST 服务器或连接已有仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "S3-Compatible": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S3 兼容存储"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SFTP / NAS": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SFTP / NAS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Schedule": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "频率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Schedule: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份频率：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secret access key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secret Access Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server URL": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器 URL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server URL is required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器 URL 为必填"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up Your First Backup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置我的第一个备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up a Backup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始设置备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在访达中显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip backups when nothing has changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内容没有变化时跳过备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip cache folders": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过缓存文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skips folders that apps mark as caches. They are rebuilt automatically, so backing them up costs space and time for nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过被应用标记为缓存的文件夹。这些内容会自动重建，备份它们只会白白占用空间和时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start at Login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开机时自动启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start the first backup now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即开始首次备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Step %lld of %lld: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第 %1$lld 步，共 %2$lld 步：%3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops at the disk each folder lives on. Without this, an external drive or a network share mounted inside one of them is backed up too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只备份到每个文件夹所在的那块磁盘为止。不勾选时，挂载在其中的外置硬盘或网络共享也会一并被备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggested:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summary": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The destination can't be changed. To back up somewhere else, create a new backup plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份目的地无法更改。若要备份到其他位置，请新建一个备份计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The destination can't be inside a folder you're backing up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标位置不能在正在备份的文件夹里面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first backup starts as soon as you create the plan. After that, backups run on this schedule, catching up automatically if your Mac was asleep or off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次备份会在创建计划后立即开始；之后按此计划运行，睡眠或关机错过的时间点会自动补跑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last repository check failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次仓库检查失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last retention pass could not get a lock on the repository": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一次保留策略清理没能获得仓库的锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan is created but stays idle: the first backup runs at %@, then on this schedule — catching up automatically if your Mac was asleep or off. You can always start one yourself with Back Up Now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "计划会创建好但先不动：首次备份将在 %@ 运行，之后按此计划进行——睡眠或关机错过的时间点会自动补跑。你也随时可以用「立即备份」手动跑一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thins older snapshots to daily, weekly and monthly keepers and reclaims the space — after a backup, at most once a week. Keep everything never deletes a snapshot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将较旧的快照按每日、每周、每月逐级精简并回收空间——在备份完成后进行，每周最多一次。“保留全部”不会删除任何快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup plan no longer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个备份计划已经不存在了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears locks left behind by a backup that was interrupted — the usual reason cleanup keeps failing. A backup running right now on another Mac keeps its own lock and is left alone; that one has to finish on its own.\n\nKeelhaven retries this plan's backup right after unlocking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会清除被中断的备份留下的锁 —— 清理反复失败通常就是这个原因。如果此刻另一台 Mac 正在备份，它的锁不受影响，那次备份得由它自己跑完。\n\n解锁后 Keelhaven 会立即重试这个计划的备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder already contains a backup repository. Connect to it under Advanced options, or choose an empty folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件夹里已经有一个备份仓库了。可以在“高级选项”里选择接入它，或者换一个空文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type My Own Instead": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改为自己输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
